        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4623, Traditional 18 Inch Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Traditional Appliance Pull features decorative ends that add a touch of classic design. This Traditional 18 Inch Refrigerator Pull is available in a huge selection of finish colors so you will be able to find exactly what you are looking for. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on an appliance panel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/urn-tip-door-handle-rk-international-ph-4622\"><b>12 Inch Traditional Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/plain-pull-with-decorative-ends-rk-international-cp-815\"><b>Traditional Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the RK International PH-4623 18 Inch Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 21-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
